meta {
  name: Get All Vehicle Name
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/vehicle/name
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get All Vehicle Name

  This request is used to get all vehicle name. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and has a protected routes.

  ## Responses

  **200 — Vehicle fetched successfully.** Ordered in ascending order by `deleted_at` and descending by `vehicle_name` and `vehicle_plate_number`
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "vehicle fetched successfully",
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "2d98f524-de02-11ed-b5ea-0242ac120002",
        "vehicle_name": "Brio RS MT",
        "vehicle_plate_number": "D 1610 ZBC",
        "deleted_at": "2025-01-29 15:04:18"
      }
    ]
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — vehicle failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "vehicle not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}